-- Child Development Co-Savings Act 2001: INDEPENDENT TESTS.
--
-- Each expected value comes from independent-expectations.md. Those values
-- were written from ../source/CDCSA2001.txt before this author read any
-- encoding module. The E-numbers refer to that file. A failing assertion here
-- is a finding: the expected values are never edited to match the encoding.

§ `Independent tests`

§§ `Helpers`

GIVEN c IS A DATE, edd IS A DATE, still IS A BOOLEAN, citizen IS A BOOLEAN, later IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A Birth
`ib` c edd still citizen later MEANS Birth WITH
    `confinement on` IS c
    `estimated delivery date` IS edd
    `stillborn` IS still
    `a citizen at birth (or would have been, if stillborn)` IS citizen
    `became a citizen on` IS later

GIVEN c IS A DATE
GIVETH A Birth
`citizen birth` c MEANS `ib` c c FALSE TRUE NOTHING

GIVEN c IS A DATE, edd IS A DATE
GIVETH A Birth
`citizen birth with EDD` c edd MEANS `ib` c edd FALSE TRUE NOTHING

GIVEN c IS A DATE, edd IS A DATE
GIVETH A Birth
`stillbirth` c edd MEANS `ib` c edd TRUE TRUE NOTHING

GIVEN born IS A DATE, applied IS A DATE, cpr IS A BOOLEAN, pr IS A BOOLEAN, pass IS A MAYBE DATE, citizen IS A BOOLEAN, natural IS A BOOLEAN, joint IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN Adoption
`ia` born applied cpr pr pass citizen natural joint MEANS Adoption WITH
    `child born on` IS born
    `application made on` IS applied
    `the child is a citizen or permanent resident when the application is made` IS cpr
    `the child is a permanent resident (not a citizen) then` IS pr
    `dependant's pass issued on` IS pass
    `an applicant (or the joint applicant spouse) is a citizen on the relevant date` IS citizen
    `the applicant is the natural parent` IS natural
    `joint application with spouse` IS joint

GIVEN born IS A DATE, applied IS A DATE
GIVETH AN Adoption
`citizen child application` born applied MEANS `ia` born applied TRUE FALSE NOTHING TRUE FALSE TRUE

GIVEN d IS A DATE, dead IS A BOOLEAN, adopted IS A BOOLEAN, withdrawn IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Earlier specified event`
`prev` d dead adopted withdrawn MEANS `Earlier specified event` WITH
    `occurred on` IS d
    `each child is dead or was stillborn` IS dead
    `each child adopted by another person, not jointly with her` IS adopted
    `an adoption application since withdrawn or refused` IS withdrawn

GIVEN s IS A `Work status`, months IS A NUMBER, days IS A NUMBER, wi IS A NUMBER, gross IS A NUMBER, daily IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Work facts`
`iw` s months days wi gross daily MEANS `Work facts` WITH
    `status` IS s
    `months of service or of carrying on before the event` IS months
    `days employed or self-employed in the 12 months before` IS days
    `the 90-day overseas conditions are met, if any days were outside Singapore` IS TRUE
    `weekly index` IS wi
    `gross pay (or lost income) per week of work days` IS gross
    `total income per day in the prescribed period` IS daily

GIVEN r IS A `Parent role`, e IS A `Child event`, n IS A NUMBER, w IS A `Work facts`, married IS A BOOLEAN, other IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Parent case`
`icase` r e n w married other MEANS `Parent case` WITH
    `role` IS r
    `event` IS e
    `specified event number` IS n
    `work` IS w
    `lawfully married to the other parent in time` IS married
    `the other parent is also eligible for shared parental leave` IS other
    `units allocated under the arrangement` IS NOTHING
    `weeks elected by the mother under s 12E(5)` IS 0

GIVEN mar IS A BOOLEAN, later IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Father's marital facts`
`fm` mar later MEANS `Father's marital facts` WITH
    `the natural father, a party married to another at conception` IS mar
    `the parents later married each other on` IS later

GIVETH AN `Incapacity substitutes`
`no incapacity substitutes` MEANS `Incapacity substitutes` WITH
    `a donee of a lasting power of attorney with the authority` IS FALSE
    `a deputy appointed by the court with the power` IS FALSE

