#ASSERT `the substitute trustee for` `(e) the trustee dead` `, the member has a legal guardian:` FALSE `, incapacity substitutes` `no incapacity substitutes` `, a nominee approved by the Minister:` FALSE EQUALS "the trustee's personal representative"
